WEBVTT

00:17:58.978 --> 00:18:02.629
I think people felt very emboldened

00:18:02.653 --> 00:18:05.398
to do what they thought
was right for the customer.

00:18:05.843 --> 00:18:08.602
If you were the community
manager of a building

00:18:08.626 --> 00:18:12.111
and it wasn't part
of the standard operating procedures

00:18:12.135 --> 00:18:17.434
to have, you know, nondairy milk,
but you had a member who needed it,

00:18:17.458 --> 00:18:18.685
they would go do it.

00:18:18.709 --> 00:18:21.313
That's kind of a silly little example,

00:18:21.337 --> 00:18:24.348
but there are places
where you could find yourself

00:18:24.372 --> 00:18:28.051
caught in bureaucracy for weeks
to be able to do something like that.

00:18:28.075 --> 00:18:30.781
And they felt, you know, I think,